<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan bank gets 530 mln rupees in operation.</title>
<headline>Pakistan bank gets 530 mln rupees in operation.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State (central) Bank of Pakistan (SBP) has accepted 530 million rupees in its weekly open market operation in Short-Term Federal Bonds on Wednesday, a SBP statement said.</p>
<p>			    Offered    Accepted    Max cut-off</p>
<p>Outright sale	   1,130 million  530 million     17.25 pct/yr</p>
<p>($1=40.34 rupees)</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
